M Driver and Mushiking: King of the Beetles, along with Saiyuki Hiro Go-Kū Den!, Chōhenshin Gag Gaiden!! Card Warrior Kamen Riders, Go-Go-Go Saiyuki: Shin Gokūden and more. Konishi was the recipient of the 38th Kodansha manga award in 2014 and the 60th Shogakukan manga award in 2015.\nL33: ### Read YO-KAI WATCH manga\nL34: \nL35: Final Volume!\nL36: \nL37: #### YO-KAI WATCH, Vol. 23\nL38: \nL39: Whisper, Nate’s trusty Yo-Kai advisor, suddenly disappears! The bond between them sparks an event that shakes the Yo-Kai World and brings all kinds of mischievous spirits out to play. Don’t miss this final volume that ties together Yo-Kai Watch stories from the manga, anime, movies, and video game!\nL40: \nL41: 【17†Buy now】\nL42: ### Other YO-KAI WATCH volumes\nL43: \nL44: 【18†See all >】\nL45: \nL46: Manga\nL47: \nL48: 【19†YO-KAI WATCH, Vol. 22】\nL49: \nL50: Manga\nL51: \nL52: 【20†YO-KAI WATCH, Vol. 21】\nL53: \nL54: Manga\nL55: \nL56: 【21†YO-KAI WATCH, Vol. 20】\nL57: \nL58: Series Debut!\nL59: \nL60: Manga\nL61: \nL62: 【22†YO-KAI WATCH, Vol. 1】\nL63: \nL64: 【18†See all >】\nL65: \nL66: ### If you like YO-KAI WATCH, VIZ Editors recommend:\nL67: \nL68: 【23†Dragon Ball】\nL69: \nL70: 【24†The Legend of Zelda】\nL71: \nL72: 【25†LBX】\nL73: \nL74: 【3†Pokémon】\nL75: \nL76: 【26†Image†dw9to29mmj727.cloudfront.net】\nL77: ### Get the latest manga & anime news!\nL78: \nL79: You’ll never miss a beat when you subscribe to our newsletter.\nL80: \nL81: [Input: Enter your email address] [Button: Sign Up]\nL82: ## Subscribe to the VIZ Newsletter\nL83: \nL84: [Input]\nL85: \nL86: E-mail\nL87: \nL88: [Input]\nL89: \nL90: First Name\nL91: \nL92: [Input]\nL93: \nL94: Last Name\nL95: \nL96: [Input]\nL97: \nL98: Birthday\nL99: \nL100: [Select]\nL101: \nL102: [Select]\nL103: \nL104: [Select]\nL105: \nL106: Newsletters\nL107: \nL108: [Input] Anime [Input] Manga [Input] Shonen Jump Chapters [Input] VIZ Manga Chapters\nL109: \nL110: [Button: Subscribe]\nL111: \nL112: By subscribing, I agree to VIZ's 【27†Te